{"file": "C:/Users/Garrett/Sports/docs/arxiv-program/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/1367-kelly-criterion-simple-random-walk-levy-processes.md", "equation": "1. **Non-binary payoff sizing (the adapt):** for props/derivatives with non-binary payouts (e.g. \"player to score 2+ TDs\" at +350 with graded payouts), estimate the return distribution r from the engine's outcome simulations and maximize gr(f) = E[ln(1+fr)] numerically (1-D concave problem — trivial to solve per pick); fall back to binary Kelly when the payout is binary.", "page_or_eqnum": null, "wave": 9133}
