{"file": "C:/Users/Garrett/Sports/docs/arxiv-program/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/1368-kelly-criterion-ornstein-uhlenbeck-processes.md", "equation": "Global correlations:** total optimal fraction = (μ_1(t) − r)/σ² (eq. 26) — n correlated assets behave like one; long-run limit f*(∞) = (a_1 + ½σ² − r)/σ² if b_1 = 0, else (½σ² − r)/σ² (eq. 28).", "page_or_eqnum": null, "wave": 9133}
