{"file": "C:/Users/Garrett/Sports/docs/arxiv-program/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/1370-learning-performance-prediction-markets-kelly-bettors.md", "equation": "Kelly fraction (odds form):** f* = (b·p − (1−p))/b; prediction-market form f* = (p − p_m)/(1 − p_m); trade q* = f*·w/p_m (buy if q* > 0, sell/short if q* < 0).", "page_or_eqnum": null, "wave": 9133}
